[node name="Content1" type="Label" parent="HowToPlay/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/Content/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1682886668]
layout_mode = 2
theme = ExtResource("15_8dnnj")
theme_override_constants/line_spacing = 9
text = "The goal is simple.
You, the streamer, are given an image you
must draw within the time limit.

You use Left Click to draw, Right click to
Erase, and you have a color picker to the
right. Don't take too long, you are timed!


And you, the Viewers, have one goal...
don't let them.
You are given coordinates on the grid, and
You may use commands to pick a cell to
erase.
There is a cooldown on how often
cells can be erased. So pay attention to
the little clock in the top left!

EXAMPLE: Streamer draws a pixel on A1, you
type \"!A1\" and it will erase that cell

Once the timer runs out, you will be
scored on how much of the image you were
able to re-create.

Within the settings menu there will be
sliders to control the game timer, and the
cooldown timer for the viewers commands.
Adjust these as you wish."

